普段使っている個人的な墓地が荒らされて困るトホホ回。\n\nよろしくお願いします！", "nc": 9, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 487126, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "眠杜🌳💤個人勢Vtuber", "screen_name": "vMintovV", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1940965761452781568/9SYkczLw.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1235229630946095105/1672644025/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "voice"}], "nc": 16}, {"id": 937883, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "多加那ｳｫﾆ", "screen_name": "WoNi_o_o_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1735317765001760768/3jLZmwWQ.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1299126326272565251/1706490644/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "voice"}, {"genre": "art"}], "nc": 129}, {"id": 3026111, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "mochi2", "screen_name": "mochi110_110", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1942465748590292992/gA3MhYjg.jpg", "header_url": null, "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 1}, {"id": 3240676, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "いつきり君 ✧【X版ちびちゃん祭】試運転開始!✍😎 🍚+■=✨🍙✨🤗", "screen_name": "riku_m